    args: [{ selector: "xh-acronis-mdr-content", standalone: true, changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, template: '<section class="pp-sec mdr-overview" id="mdr-overview" aria-labelledby="mdr-overview-title">\r\n  <div class="wrap">\r\n    <div class="sec-h left">\r\n      <div class="eyebrow">Overview</div>\r\n      <h2 id="mdr-overview-title">What is Acronis MDR?</h2>\r\n      <p>Acronis Managed Detection and Response (MDR) combines security technology with a team of specialists who monitor, investigate and respond to threats on your behalf. The Acronis Threat Research Unit provides round-the-clock security operations, helping your organisation identify suspicious activity and contain attacks.</p>\r\n      <p>Delivered by XcellHost, the service brings together continuous monitoring, proactive threat hunting, incident response and integrated recovery. Your team gets expert support to manage security incidents without having to build and operate its own security operations centre.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec navy" id="mdr-why"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Why MDR</div><h2>You have the tools. Do you have the operations?</h2><p>MDR is a managed service, not a product \u2014 a SOC that operates your detection and response for you, so protection is always on.</p></div><div class="grid2"><div class="whyc rv"><span class="whyi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></span><div><b>You can\u2019t staff a 24/7 SOC</b><span>Clients expect always-on protection, but building and running a round-the-clock SOC in-house is neither cost-effective nor scalable for most businesses.</span></div></div><div class="whyc rv"><span class="whyi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-7 11-7 11 7 11 7-4 7-11 7-11-7-11-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><div><b>Tools aren\u2019t enough</b><span>EDR and XDR give visibility and investigative insight \u2014 but they still rely on human experts to analyse alerts, respond to threats and run root-cause investigations.</span></div></div><div class="whyc rv"><span class="whyi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.3 3.9L1.8 18a2 2 0 001.7 3h17a2 2 0 001.7-3L14.4 3.9a2 2 0 00-3.4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg></span><div><b>Alerts outpace people</b><span>Modern threats move fast and generate constant alerts. Without a dedicated team, real incidents get lost in the noise \u2014 and dwell time grows.</span></div></div><div class="whyc rv"><span class="whyi"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z"/></svg></span><div><b>Response time is the risk</b><span>An internal team\u2019s typical MTTR is ~11 hours. With Acronis MDR, defined SLAs cut that to under 1 hour \u2014 and critical incidents to ~15 minutes.</span></div></div></div></div></section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec ice" id="mdr-what-you-get"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">What you get</div><h2>A world-class SOC, delivered as a service</h2></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-7 11-7 11 7 11 7-4 7-11 7-11-7-11-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><h3>24/7 monitoring & rapid response</h3><p>Continuous endpoint monitoring, threat triage and rapid isolation by the Acronis Threat Research Unit \u2014 critical incidents remediated in as little as 15 minutes.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><h3>Expert threat hunting</h3><p>World-class SOC analysts proactively hunt for threats and run root-cause investigations \u2014 the seniority and depth a mid-sized team can\u2019t staff in-house.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Integrated proactive protection</h3><p>Built-in patch management closes vulnerabilities before they\u2019re exploited \u2014 proactive defence, not just reactive alerting.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 4v6h-6M1 20v-6h6"/><path d="M3.5 9a9 9 0 0115-3.4L23 10M1 14l4.5 4.4A9 9 0 0020.5 15"/></svg></span><h3>Built-in business continuity</h3><p>Attack rollback and integrated recovery mean incidents are not just contained but reversed \u2014 affected systems restored on the same platform.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7l10-5z"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5M2 17l10 5 10-5"/></svg></span><h3>Unified platform</h3><p>One agent and one console on Acronis Cyber Protect Cloud \u2014 EDR/XDR, vulnerability management, patching and backup together, cutting tool sprawl.</p></div><div class="card rv"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Defined SLAs & reporting</h3><p>Published response commitments, clear escalation, and reporting you can hand to clients or leadership \u2014 with monthly reviews.</p></div></div></div></section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec" id="mdr-how"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>Monitor. Detect. Respond. Recover.</h2><p>A closed loop from alert to restored, run by the SOC for you.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.00s"><span class="n">01</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-7 11-7 11 7 11 7-4 7-11 7-11-7-11-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><h3>Monitor</h3><p>The SOC continuously monitors your endpoints and telemetry on the Acronis platform \u2014 automated engines plus human experts.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.08s"><span class="n">02</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.3 3.9L1.8 18a2 2 0 001.7 3h17a2 2 0 001.7-3L14.4 3.9a2 2 0 00-3.4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Detect & triage</h3><p>Suspicious activity is detected, triaged and investigated by TRU analysts \u2014 real incidents separated from noise.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.16s"><span class="n">03</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z"/></svg></span><h3>Contain & respond</h3><p>T