roke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/></svg></span><h3>Email archiving</h3><p class="dx-p">Built for <b>compliance & discovery</b> \u2014 a permanent, tamper-proof record of every message.</p><ul class="dx-list"><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Immutable journaling of every email</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Preserved even if deleted from the mailbox</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Legal hold & eDiscovery</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Retention from 30 days to indefinite</li></ul></div></div></div></section>\r\n\r\n<section class="archive-section navy" id="intro"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h "><div class="eyebrow">End to end</div><h2>From compliance to recovery \u2014 archiving that does it all.</h2><p>One system to capture, seal, search and retain every message across your mail platforms.</p></div><div class="grid3"><div class="pp-whycard " style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h4>Compliance without complexity</h4><p>Capture every message in real time with immutable journaling for Microsoft 365 and Google Workspace. Meet legal, regulatory and business requirements with built-in policy controls and audit logging \u2014 no ex