0 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Live expert-led demo</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Foundational AI skills</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Q&A with our team</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>In-person or online</li></ul><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" (click)="requestTraining($event)">Register interest <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div><div class="pk feat"><span class="pk-badge or">Most popular</span><div class="pk-h"><h3>Role-based workshop</h3><span>Half day</span></div><p>Hands-on Copilot for a specific team \u2014 leadership, finance, IT, sales, HR or operations.</p><ul class="pk-feats"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Role-specific scenarios</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Guided hands-on prompts</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Prompt library for your team</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>In your own tenant</li></ul><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#" (click)="requestTraining($event)">Register interest <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg><span class="sh"></span></a></div><div class="pk"><div class="pk-h"><h3>Adoption programme</h3><span>Multi-session</span></div><p>A structured rollout to drive real Copilot adoption across the whole organisation.</p><ul class="pk-feats"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Blended live + self-paced</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Champions enablement</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Adoption tracking & reporting</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Governance & safe-use guidance</li></ul><a class="btn btn-line" href="#" (click)="requestTraining($event)">Register interest <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div></div></div></section>\r\n\r\n<section class="training-section navy" id="who"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h"><div class="eyebrow">Who it\u2019s for</div><h2>Copilot training for every role</h2></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 3a3 3 0 00-3 3 3 3 0 00-2 5 3 3 0 001 5 3 3 0 005 2 3 3 0 005-2 3 3 0 001-5 3 3 0 00-2-5 3 3 0 00-3-3 3 3 0 00-2 1 3 3 0 00-2-1z"/><path d="M12 5v14"/></svg></span><h3>Executive leadership</