    args: [{ selector: "xh-iot-infrastructure-content", standalone: true, changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy8.OnPush, template: '<section class="pp-sec " id="protocols"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h "><div class="eyebrow">Any protocol</div><h2>Speak every device\u2019s language.</h2><p>One multi-protocol gateway ingests from constrained sensors to industrial controllers \u2014 no rearchitecting to add a new device type.</p></div><div class="grid4 pr-grid"><div class="pr-card " style="--d:0.0s"><b>MQTT 5.0</b><p>Lightweight pub/sub for constrained devices</p></div><div class="pr-card " style="--d:0.1s"><b>CoAP</b><p>Compact REST for low-power networks</p></div><div class="pr-card " style="--d:0.1s"><b>AMQP 1.0</b><p>Reliable enterprise message queuing</p></div><div class="pr-card " style="--d:0.2s"><b>HTTP/2 & WebSocket</b><p>Web-native device connectivity</p></div><div class="pr-card " style="--d:0.0s"><b>LoRaWAN</b><p>Long-range, low-power wide-area networks</p></div><div class="pr-card " style="--d:0.1s"><b>OPC-UA</b><p>Industrial automation interoperability</p></div><div class="pr-card " style="--d:0.1s"><b>Modbus TCP</b><p>Legacy industrial device integration</p></div><div class="pr-card " style="--d:0.2s"><b>LwM2M</b><p>Device management for IoT fleets</p></div></div></div></section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec ice" id="metrics"><div class="wrap"><div class="cs-strip"><div class="cs-stat " style="--d:0.0s"><b>10M<em>msg/s</em></b><span>MQTT broker throughput per node</span></div><div class="cs-stat " style="--d:0.1s"><b>70<em>ms</em></b><span>Edge gateway latency</span></div><div class="cs-stat " style="--d:0.1s"><b>500K<em>+</em></b><span>Concurrent devices per cluster</span></div><div class="cs-stat " style="--d:0.2s"><b>1<em>TB/day</em></b><span>Data ingestion per region</span></div><div class="cs-stat " style="--d:0.2s"><b>99.99<em>%</em></b><span>Uptime SLA</span></div><div class="cs-stat " style="--d:0.3s"><b>10<em>+</em></b><span>Protocols supported</span></div></div></div></section>\r\n\r\n<section class="pp-sec " id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h "><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>How data flows, device to cloud</h2><p>The same pipeline runs everywhere \u2014 connect, process at the edge, analyse, then sync \u2014 so latency stays low and bandwidth stays cheap.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step " style="--d:0.00s"><span class="n">01</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><path d="M16.2 7.8a6 6 0 010 8.4M7.8 16.2a6 6 0 010-8.4M19.1 4.9a10 10 0 010 14.2M4.9 19.1a10 10 0 010-14.2"/></svg></span><h3>Connect</h3><p>Devices connect over MQTT, CoAP, LoRaWAN and more through the multi-protocol edge gateway, each with a verified X.509 identity.</p></div><div class="step " style="--d:0.12s"><span class="n">02</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M1 9h3M1 15h3M20 9h3M20 15h3"/></svg></span><h3>Process at the edge</h3><p>The edge node filters, aggregates and enriches telemetry locally \u2014 cutting bandwidth up to 80% and delivering sub-70ms responses.</p></div><div class="step " style="--d:0.24s"><span class="n">03</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><h3>Analyse & act</h3><p>Kafka + Flink stream analytics drive real-time dashboards, alerts and automated actions on live device data.</p></div><div class="step " style="--d:0.36s"><span class="n">04</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 000-9 6 6 0 00-11.6 1.5A3.8 3.8 0 006.5 19h11z"/></svg></span><h3>Sync & manage</h3><p>Data syncs to the Mumbai cloud for long-term analytics; OTA updates and device management flow back down securely.</p></div></div></div></section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec ice" id="platform"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h "><div class="eyebrow">Platform</div><h2>Everything from device to dashboard.</h2><p>A complete IoT platform \u2014 connectivity, identity, edge processing, analytics, security and lifecycle management, all managed by XcellHost.</p></div><div class="grid4"><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M1 9h3M1 15h3M20 9h3M20 15h3"/></svg></span><h3>Edge processing</h3><p>Filter and aggregate at the edge \u2014 cut backhaul bandwidth by up to 80% versus sending raw telemetry to the cloud.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 007 0l3-3a5 5 0 00-7-7l-1 1"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 00-7 0l-3 3a5 5 0 007 7l1-1"/></svg></span><h3>Multi-protocol gateway</h3><p>A single gateway normalises 10+ protocols into one stream, so every device type joins the same pipeline.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 2l-2 2m-7.6 7.6a5.5 5.5 0 11-7.8 7.8 5.5 5.5 0 017.8-7.8zm0 0L19 3m-4 4l3 3"/></svg></span><h3>Device identity & PKI</h3><p>X.509 certificates and mutual TLS give every device a verifiable identity \u2014 no rogue devices on your network.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><h3>Real-time analytics</h3><p>Kafka + Flink stream processing turns device data into live dashboards and alerts in milliseconds.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/></svg></span><h3>AES-256 encryption</h3><p>End-to-end encryption in transit and at rest, with your data kept inside India for DPDP compliance.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 4v6h-6M1 20v-6h6"/><path d="M3.5 9a9 9 0 0114.9-3.4L23 10M1 14l4.6 4.4A9 9 0 0020.5 15"/></svg></span><h3>OTA firmware updates</h3><p>Signed, delta over-the-air updates with automatic rollback on failed health checks.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.5 19a4.5 4.5 0 000-9 6 6 0 00-11.6 1.5A3.8 3.8 0 006.5 19h11z"/></svg></span><h3>Hybrid sync</h3><p>Buffer at the edge during connectivity loss and sync to the cloud when the link returns \u2014 no lost data.</p></div><div class="card tilt " style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 010 20M12 2a15 15 0 000 20"/></svg></span><h3>Private LoRaWAN</h3><p>Run your own long-range, low-power networks for wide-area sensing across fields, plants and cities.</p></div></div></div></section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec " id="usecases"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h "><div class="eyebrow">Industry use cases</div><h2>From factory floors to farm fields.</h2><p>XcellHost IoT powers diverse industries \u2014 each with a real challenge, the infrastructure that solved it, and the outcome delivered.</p></div><div class="grid4 uc-grid"><div class="uc-card man " style="--d:0.0s"><h3>Smart Manufacturing</h3><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>Challenge</span><p>Factory-floor PLCs, CNC machines and robotic arms produced siloed telemetry with no way to predict failures before costly downtime.</p></div><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><path d="M6 6h.01M6 18h.01"/></svg>Infrastructure</span><p>Multi-protocol edge gateways ingest Modbus/OPC-UA data, streamed into XcellHost\u2019s real-time analytics pipeline (Kafka + Flink).</p></div><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 6l-9.5 9.5-5-5L1 18"/><path d="M17 6h6v6"/></svg>Outcome</span><p>Predictive-maintenance alerts fire before failures occur, cutting unplanned downtime significantly.</p></div></div><div class="uc-card agri " style="--d:0.1s"><h3>Agriculture & Rural IoT</h3><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>Challenge</span><p>Soil sensors, weather stations and irrigation controllers spread across hundreds of acres needed reliable connectivity with no cellular coverage.</p></div><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><path d="M6 6h.01M6 18h.01"/></svg>Infrastructure</span><p>Private LoRaWAN network deployed on XcellHost edge infrastructure, covering a multi-kilometre radius per gateway.</p></div><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 6l-9.5 9.5-5-5L1 18"/><path d="M17 6h6v6"/></svg>Outcome</span><p>Hundreds of acres brought online on a single deployment, enabling automated irrigation scheduling.</p></div></div><div class="uc-card city " style="--d:0.2s"><h3>Smart Cities</h3><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>Challenge</span><p>Street lighting, waste management, water quality and traffic sensors ran on disconnected legacy systems with no unified visibility for city operators.</p></div><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><path d="M6 6h.01M6 18h.01"/></svg>Infrastructure</span><p>Unified multi-protocol gateway (MQTT/CoAP) feeding a single secure dashboard on XcellHost\u2019s sovereign infrastructure.</p></div><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 6l-9.5 9.5-5-5L1 18"/><path d="M17 6h6v6"/></svg>Outcome</span><p>City-wide sensor fleet consolidated onto one platform, cutting operational reporting time.</p></div></div><div class="uc-card health " style="--d:0.2s"><h3>Healthcare & Wearables</h3><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>Challenge</span><p>Patient monitors, glucose meters and ECG patches generated sensitive health data requiring HIPAA-ready ingestion with zero tolerance for delay.</p></div><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2"/><path d="M6 6h.01M6 18h.01"/></svg>Infrastructure</span><p>End-to-end encrypted ingestion pipeline (AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit) with per-device X.509 identity.</p></div><div class="uc-row"><span class="uc-lbl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 6l-9.5 9.5-5-5L1 18"/><path d="M17 6h6v6"/></svg>Outcome</span><p>Real-time alerting on patient vitals with full compliance and a complete audit trail.</p></div></div></div></div></section>\r\n<section class="pp-sec ice" id="compare"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h "><div class="eyebrow">Comparison</div><h2>XcellHost IoT vs others.</h2><p>See why Indian enterprises choose XcellHost for sovereign IoT deployments.</p></div><div class="tbl-w "><table class="tbl cm-tbl"><thead><tr><th>