  <div class="pp-sec">Before &amp; after DMARC</div>\r
  <div class="eng-grid">\r
    <div class="eng-copy ">\r
      <p>Without DMARC, anyone can send email that looks exactly like it&rsquo;s from your domain &mdash; so phishing goes out in your name, and your genuine mail often lands in spam because inbox providers can&rsquo;t tell what&rsquo;s real.</p>\r
      <p>With <b>XcellHost Enterprise DMARC</b>, only your authorised senders can use your domain. Spoofed mail is rejected, your real mail is trusted, and you can see exactly what&rsquo;s happening.</p>\r
