ve data protection for AI</h3>\r\n        <p>Monitor and block the unauthorised transmission of sensitive data\u2014like PII and PHI\u2014into AI tools, cutting data-leak and compliance risk.</p>\r\n        <ul><li>Inspect prompts for sensitive content</li><li>Block PII / PHI submissions</li><li>Reduce leakage &amp; compliance risk</li></ul>\r\n      </article>\r\n      <article class="genai-pillar prevent">\r\n        <span class="pillar-label">Prevent</span><i class="material-symbols-outlined">block</i>\r\n        <h3>Harmful prompts &amp; AI abuse prevention</h3>\r\n        <p>Detect and block malicious prompt techniques like prompt injection that try to manipulate AI behaviour or slip harmful content into your workflows.</p>\r\n        <ul><li>Detect prompt injection</li><li>Block abusive prompts</li><li>Protect users &amp; systems</li></ul>\r\n      </article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class="genai-section genai-console-section" id="console" aria-labelledby="genai-console-title">\r\n    <div class="genai-heading centered">\r\n      <span>Inside GenAI Protection</span>\r\n      <h2 id="genai-console-title">Discover, monitor, protect and prove\u2014in one console</h2>\r\n      <p>Everything runs from a single console. Switch views to see how it works.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class="genai-console">\r\n      <div class="console-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="GenAI Protection console views">\r\n        @for (view of consoleViews; track view.id) {\r\n          <button type="button" role="tab" [class.is-active]="activeConsoleView() === view.id" [attr.aria-selected]="activeConsoleView() === view.id" (click)="selectConsoleView(view.id)">{{ view.label }}</button>\r\n        }\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class="console-body">\r\n        <div class="console-copy">\r\n          <small>{{ currentConsoleView().eyebrow }}</small>\r\n          <h3>{{ currentConsoleView().title }}</h3>\r\n          <p>{{ currentConsoleView().description }}</p>\r\n